{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月9日 16:27 星期一</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月9日 16:34 星期一</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>食環署指，​元朗「光榮冰室」因食物室不潔及未有妥善維修其衞生設備，屢次違反《食物業規例》，今日（9日）已取消其牌照，須即時停業。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>署方發言人指，有關食肆經營者因違例事項，在今年8月八次被法庭定罪，共罰款4000元，署方根據違例記分制記下持牌人65分，食肆因此被取消牌照。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕光榮冰室 食環署 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.086853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:27:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:52.091143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:30.496651+00:00","content_hash":"0b9658f7006598efd3ba2d5a0ff3b229f9ffbe10ede30423aea66555c5ab3e5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.086853+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}